#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:5 ca0403528c48406eafd2898747cad4fe
msgid "Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:6 87fc96384f9047158344d22e3b4059d0
msgid ""
"The battery failsafe can be configured to automatically switch the vehicle "
"into SURFACE mode or disarm if the vehicle battery voltage drops below a "
"specified voltage for 10 seconds or the estimated remaining capacity has "
"dropped below a configurable threshold."
msgstr ""
"电池失控保护可配置为：当飞行器电池电压持续 10 秒低于指定电压，或估算剩余容量降至可配置阈值以下时，自动将飞行器切换至 Surface "
"模式或锁定电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:10 d5cf5517175242ad8a9481eff25638a2
msgid ""
"This failsafe requires the vehicle have a working :ref:`Power Module "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>`."
msgstr "此失控保护要求飞行器配备可正常工作的 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:12 e76df26d7dfe430cab28ea8a90ae00ac
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to 9 batteries/power monitors. The discussion below "
"applies to those optional batteries also. Each can trigger a failsafe and "
"each can have different actions and setup values. In addition, a group of "
"batteries can be treated as a single unit, see ``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持最多 9 "
"块电池/电源监视器。以下讨论同样适用于这些可选电池。每块电池均可触发失控保护，且每块可配置不同的动作和设定值。此外，一组电池可被视为单一单元，参见 "
"``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:15 475b380b14b1429e88ffc6b4ed177271
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "何时触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:16 eaca3b40783e4123bcffffcf39a0407f
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the battery failsafe will trigger if the "
"main battery's:"
msgstr "如果已启用且正确配置，当主电池出现以下情况时电池失控保护将触发："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:18 391e24f161c34a69a958be8580ce7705
msgid ""
"voltage drops below the voltage held in the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter (or FS_BATT_VOLTAGE in older versions) for more "
"than 10 seconds. The default voltage is 10.5 volts. If set to zero, the "
"voltage based trigger will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"电压持续超过 10 秒低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数（或旧版本中的 "
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE）所存储的电压值。默认电压为 10.5V。如果设为零，则禁用基于电压的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:19 05bc142c9d9b491fa4be570cb7995493
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"remaining capacity falls below the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` "
"parameter (or FS_BATT_MAH in older versions) 20% of the battery's full "
"capacity is a good choice (i.e. \"1000\" for a 5000mAh battery). If set to "
"zero, the capacity based trigger will be disabled (i.e. only voltage will be"
" used)"
msgstr ""
"剩余容量低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` 参数（旧版本中为 "
"FS_BATT_MAH）设定值，建议设为电池总容量的 20%（例如 5000mAh 电池设为 "
"「1000」）。设为零则禁用基于容量的触发（即仅使用电压触发）。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:22 4a138a35bc5144c59b801ad0aa1356a7
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:23 a7ad56273d614a648b5603485e47640b
msgid "When the failsafe is triggered:"
msgstr "失控保护触发时："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:25 610025c67b2e498db50ef9b0cd77dacd
msgid "Buzzer will play a loud low-battery alarm"
msgstr "蜂鸣器将发出响亮的低电量警报"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:26 64c7dfdfac054673ba4f647e80fce9ca
msgid "LEDs will flash yellow"
msgstr "LED 将闪烁黄色"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:27 72abd0430e1f430bbab14043b79d1e82
msgid ""
"\"Low Battery!\" will be displayed on the ground station's HUD (if telemetry"
" is connected)"
msgstr "地面站 HUD 将显示「Low Battery!」（低电量！）（如数传已连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:29 8613aca7435b4aacab3d6464cf810f7a
msgid ""
"Then one of the following will happen, depending on "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>`:"
msgstr "然后，根据 :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 的设置，将发生以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:31 e3723bc6b4ef432fa977d48dfb361f16
msgid "**Nothing**  (value 0)"
msgstr "**无操作** （值 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:32 b48c0e08b2a942cb8f58c6d05282e5a3
msgid "**Disarm motors** (value 1)"
msgstr "**锁定电机** （值 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:33 ba7d5db9364846e1adbd58ff8178d2d3
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Enter SURFACE mode** (value 2)"
msgstr "**锁定电机** （值 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:35 0a6a7739004245039926d61ae7cc0655
msgid ""
"As with all failsafes, the user can re-take control of the vehicle by "
"changing the flight mode switch to another mode. The battery failsafe will "
"not trigger again unless the two-layer failsafe is setup (see below)"
msgstr ""
"与所有失控保护一样，用户可以通过将飞行模式开关切换到另一个模式重新接管飞行器控制。除非设置了双层失控保护（见下文），否则电池失控保护不会再次触发"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:39 24a2d78c9f9348d49f130682a2e2a436
msgid ""
"Once a battery failsafe has triggered, it cannot be reset until the "
"autopilot is rebooted."
msgstr "电池失控保护一旦触发，在飞控重启之前无法复位。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:42 701061de64234b11bf89486f6ab5b09d
msgid "Setting up using Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:43 6fc356396cff409186cfdd3ba702aa33
msgid "On the **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Failsafe** page:"
msgstr "在 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Failsafe** 页面："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:45 8f78528c7da6481f98e32e097e491eaa
msgid ""
"If the Battery section parameters are greyed out follow instructions to "
"setup the :ref:`Power Module <common-powermodule-landingpage>`"
msgstr "如果电池部分参数显示为灰色，请按照说明设置 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:46 b1c4726e061046a5bbc7db6466112dac
msgid "Set the \"Low Battery\" threshold voltage (i.e. 10.5 volts)"
msgstr "设置「低电量」阈值电压（例如 10.5V）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:47 d3f1efa9132944bf8da43b68b9552053
msgid ""
"Set the \"Reserved MAH\" or leave as \"0\" if the failsafe should never "
"trigger based on estimated current consumed."
msgstr "设置\"保留 MAH\"，或如果永远不应基于估计消耗电流触发失控保护，则保留为\"0\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:48 1c2c161a1b9741bfa8e85bfca8905772
msgid ""
"Select the desired behavior (Land, RTL, SmartRTL, etc) from the drop-down "
"list"
msgstr "从下拉列表中选择所需行为（降落、RTL、SmartRTL 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:54 9df68063d9c94948b467bb049501f670
msgid "Two-Layer failsafe"
msgstr "双层失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:55 c8f1935ac6f4423f863fc2d3f0d60861
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a two-layer battery failsafe. This allows setting up a "
"follow-up action if the battery voltage or remaining capacity falls below an"
" even lower threshold."
msgstr "ArduPilot 包含双层电池失控保护功能。这允许在电池电压或剩余容量降至更低阈值时设置后续操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:57 282d70b7c1634212b9d71c3880f21a50
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - holds the secondary (lower) voltage "
"threshold. Set to zero to disable."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - 存储次级（较低）电压阈值。设为零以禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:58 81c611c5f6084334b36f98ff20a7d364
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - holds the secondary (lower) capacity "
"threshold. Set to zero to disable."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - 存储次级（较低）容量阈值。设为零以禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:59 3ea5e409f80b43a289431908e6f1d01d
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - holds the secondary action to "
"take."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` — 保存触发后的次级动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:62 fb152b0d7aae416fb440e960beffd501
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:64 b2d517d0eb2644d3a8d828ae63599cf0
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` allows configuring whether the raw "
"battery voltage or a sag corrected voltage is used"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` 允许配置使用原始电池电压还是压降校正后的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:65 ba5798c414ff482c81fb169f69c2ddce
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` can configure how long the voltage "
"must be below the threshold for the failsafe to trigger"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` 可配置电压必须低于阈值多长时间才触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:66 1ceba0106bc741d7925997e684307996
msgid ""
"``BATTx_`` parameters can be setup to trigger the failsafe on other battery "
"monitors."
msgstr "``BATTx_`` 参数可设置为在其他电池监视器上触发失控保护。"

